              {
                "formula": "1",
                "damageType": "slashing"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage to yourself as part of the action. The vishkanyan venom remains potent until the end of your next turn, or until you expend it as normal for an injury poison by either hitting a target or critically failing an attack roll."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Minor Vishkanyan Venom",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (injury, poison)"
